Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-06 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9755}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9755} {In Verification} } ) satisfies the constraint on the accuracy
