Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-07 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9756}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9756} {In Verification} } ) satisfies the rms width of the internal
