Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-08 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9757}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9757} {Verified} } ) satisfies the maximum local significance of
