Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-09 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9758}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9758} {Verified} } ) satisfies the repeatability outlier limit in u,
z, and y-bands.

Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-10 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9759}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9759} {Verified} } ) satisfies the rms photometric repeatability in
g, r, and i-bands.

Associated element DMS-REQ-0359-V-11 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9760}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9760} {In Verification} } ) satisfies the fraction of zero-point
