LVV-18224.description:
The Data Management system shall include a secure and authenticated
Internet endpoint for an IVOA-compliant HiPS service. ~

Associated element DMS-REQ-0380-V-02 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-20578}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-20578} {Not Covered} } ) satisfies the requirement on the service
being advertised via Registry~

Associated element DMS-REQ-0380-V-03 ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-20579}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-20579} {Not Covered} } ) satisfies the requirement on the service
being advertised via a community mechanism

LVV-18229.description:
This is 3 distinct requirements. OTT1 can be tested with simulated data.
L1 Data Products can be created with precursor data but requires that we
include some "worst case" datasets (in terms of density and night
length). SSObject orbit determination can be done to a certain extent
with simulated data. Will need to be verified again during
commissioning.

Associated element ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9740}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9740} {Covered} } ) satisfies the latency of reporting transients.\\
Associated element ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9803}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9803} {Covered} } ) satisfies the availability of Solar System
Object orbits.

Associated element ( {
\href{https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/browse/LVV-9744}{\hfill\break
\includegraphics[width=1.5625in,,keepaspectratio]{jira_imgs/10318}
LVV-9744} {Covered} } ) satisfies the latency of reporting optical
transients.

LVV-18271.req_spec:
\textbf{Specification:} The Header Service shall behave as a Commandable
SAL Component (CSC) following the command patterns described in \citeds{LSE-70}
and \citeds{LSE-209}.

LVV-19488.req_spec:
\textbf{Specification:} The DMS shall create an archive for all its
public data products and the raw data necessary to reproduce them,
scalable to the data from the full survey and all Data Releases.

LVV-19842.req_spec:
Intermediate outputs of Data Release Production {{[}test{]}} processing
shall be usable as inputs for later Data Release Production {{[}test{]}}
processing.
